This project provides an independent remote-camera adapter and integration
scripts for Quchaosheng/embodied-agent-runtime:
https://github.com/Quchaosheng/embodied-agent-runtime
Pinned upstream commit: 93a30014b0a260c92a1d3593889afb6dec94e257
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0.

Runtime orchestration, ROS 2 interfaces, CAN protocol handling, task history,
and the original ArUco trigger policy belong to the upstream project.
The runtime launch sequences in this project's scripts were adapted from
the upstream software E2E setup; they have been changed for image and live
camera validation. The upstream source is fetched separately, not vendored.
